PC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":4107428914,"text":"聞いた話なんだけど、冒険者っていつも野外で魔物と戦うんだって。","nextNodeIds":[200140115]},{"nodeId":200140115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":3374075234,"text":"だからそういうことも勉強したいんだけど、教えてくれる人がいなくて…","nextNodeIds":[200140116]},{"nodeId":200140116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":56917426,"text":"それに、お兄ちゃんも…","nextNodeIds":[200140117]},{"nodeId":200140117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":1212373170,"text":"ダメに決まってるだろ！魔物なんて危険すぎる！行くにしたって、経験豊富な冒険者について来てもらうんじゃなきゃ駄目だ。","nextNodeIds":[200140118]},{"nodeId":200140118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":500672090,"text":"だからジャックに声をかけたじゃない？もういい返事をもらってるよ。","nextNodeIds":[200140119]},{"nodeId":200140119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":82421674,"text":"俺はジャックのことをよく知ってる…あいつは自分のことすらままならないのに、アナを守れるはずがないだろ。","nextNodeIds":[200140120]},{"nodeId":200140120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":1765471234,"text":"でも、きっと協会も経験豊富な冒険者をすぐには見つけられないし、私だってそんな依頼を出すお金なんかないもの…","nextNodeIds":[200140121,200140122]},{"nodeId":200140121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1550051762,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}が一緒に行こうか。","nextNodeIds":[200140123]},{"nodeId":200140123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":4050192978,"text":"えっ？手伝ってくれるの？やったー！","nextNodeIds":[200140124]},{"nodeId":200140124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":3258537698,"text":"お兄ちゃん！これで安心したでしょ！","nextNodeIds":[200140125]},{"nodeId":200140125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":552233122,"text":"それは…","nextNodeIds":[200140126]},{"nodeId":200140126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":3061504794,"text":"#はぁ…しょうがない。旅人の実力は俺も知ってるからね。{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}が一緒なら、少しは安心だ…","nextNodeIds":[200140127]},{"nodeId":200140127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":716175754,"text":"だけど！野外に行くときは、くれぐれも安全に気を付けるんだぞ…","nextNodeIds":[200140128]},{"nodeId":200140128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"アンソニー","textMapHash":225932154,"text":"…それだけは覚えておくんだ、分かったか？","nextNodeIds":[200140129]},{"nodeId":200140129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":2807123242,"text":"わかったわかった…お兄ちゃんってば、耳にタコができちゃうよ…","nextNodeIds":[200140130]},{"nodeId":200140130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1405,"speakerName":"アナ","textMapHash":3204550722,"text":"旅人さん、早く行きましょう。拠点の位置は、すでにジャックから聞いてあるから。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200140122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":922764706,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}は戦闘が得意だけど。","nextNodeIds":[200140123]},{"nodeId":200140111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3905710450,"text":"どれくらい訓練したの？","nextNodeIds":[200140112]},{"nodeId":200140104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3341530850,"text":"アンソニー、何してるの？","nextNodeIds":[200140105]}]},{"talkId":2001404,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":f